WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.550
A furious blond superhero squints at an eviction notice.

2
00:00:00.550 --> 00:00:01.350
His luxury fortress is a pile of cardboard boxes beneath a bridge.

3
00:00:01.350 --> 00:00:02.700
The whole hero launches through the air, sending a furious gust along the street.

4
00:00:02.700 --> 00:00:03.650
The blast destroys the cardboard fortress. Its panels tumble away independently.

5
00:00:03.650 --> 00:00:04.400
He returns for his triumphant victory pose as his address falls from the sky.

6
00:00:04.400 --> 00:00:05.600
The hero stares at his ruined box. The security deposit has blown away.
